      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've seen a couple of similar flashes, some of them looked like the nameplate was trying to switch to the long-distance setup (with yellow shield) and back very quickly, and I believe was associated with an AV3 avatar rescaling.\nI say this to help the issue be found, not to excuse the issue, which clearly must be treated as critical and fixed.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
