      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Update on this issue. After testing with a friend we found that the issue is that icons/name plates scale by distance. This issue can be resolved by allowing name plates to be hidden after a distance much in the same way as the current beta option to hide avatars by distance.\nWhat precisely happens is a players icon/nameplate scales as they move away, and then when teleporting closer the icon/nameplate stays the same size for a fraction of a second then shrinks, giving rise to a sudden flash capable of causing seizures.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-08-14T00:28:21.720Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I've been in a few worlds where moving from one area to another will make the nameplate warp across the view of people in the area being left or entered by another player. The speed and size of this flash is enough to trigger seizures. There are also some avatar effects which will trigger the nameplate to flash in a similar manner such as avatar rescaling animations in some circumstances though was unable to determine the exact cause due to having a seizure when I saw it.",
